DTEND:20260911T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260910T233000Z
UID:b1MKf2ZiCZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nA world-famous orchestra conduct
 or discovers the brother he never knew he had — a school cafeteria worke
 r who plays trombone in a local marching band. An equally hilarious and af
 fecting crowdpleaser that premiered at Cannes and became a French box offi
 ce sensation.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-marching-band
 \n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
